Error [E0394]: Type alias cycle: Loop -> Loop
  --> tests/ui/type_alias_cycle_self.jet:1:18
    |
  1 | alias Loop<T> :: Loop<[T]>
    |                  ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Transparent type aliases must expand to a non-alias type
 Fix: Break the cycle by making one target a concrete type
